+===============+============+===========+
| #this text#   |            |           |
| ?this text?   |            |           |
| .this text.   |            |           |
| ,this text,   |            |           |
| :this text:   |            |           |
| ;this text;   |            |           |
+===============+============+===========+
| ##this text## |            |           |
| ??this text?? |            |           |
| ..this text.. |            |           |
| ,,this text,, |            |           |
| ::this text:: |            |           |
| ;;this text;; |            |           |
+===============+============+===========+
| `this text`   |            |           |
| 'this text'   |            |           |
| "this text"   |            |           |
